1. She has a strong affinity for bunny girls and bunny-themed merchandise, expressing a desire to collect bunny girl figurines. (Verbatim: "Honestly, I'm 100% serious when I say I want to build a shelf full of bunny girls.")

2. She finds bunny ears and cat ears appealing and would embrace becoming a cat girl or bunny girl if it happened. (Verbatim: "If I woke up one day and had bunny ears or cat ears, I would not want them to be removed. I would like to keep them and embrace my new cat girl bunny girl life.")

3. She expresses a desire to have a 3D model so she can hop around, indicating a future goal related to her VTuber persona. (Verbatim: "Yo, if I had a 3D model, you could see me hop around one day.")

