8. She references a fictional or humorous backstory involving a goose inspiring her to become a star to pay off a debt. (Verbatim: "In my past, precisely one year ago, I saw a beautiful, cute and lovely goose. And I'm off to become a star to pay off my one million...")

9. She values making people smile and considers a stream successful if she made at least one person smile. (Verbatim: "If I could make anyone slightly smile today, then I had a good stream. That's basically my standard for what's a good stream.")

10. She jokes about being unable to fly with her wings and finds the idea scary. (Verbatim: "Can't fly though, it's scary.") [end of text]



